==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 0.67~10 seconds<sup>20f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 0.67~10 seconds<sup>20f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.67~10 seconds<sup>20f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
This stage should be rather easy if you've completed the first two chapters of [[Empire of Cats]]. Meatshields, [[:Category:Midranger-class Cats|mid-range]] damage dealers and [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] are enough, although Cats with the [[Knockback]] ability should be used with caution as they can make your long-ranged units miss. The boss has a fast attack rate, so cats with a long attack animation like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] will likely get knocked back before they can land a single hit.

